  "limitsAssessment": {
    "reasonable": "No overflow, no status overlap, >=14px body, >=11px auxiliary and >=40px controls are useful baselines.",
    "tradeoff": "Area limits alone can reward shrinking the game viewport. C expanded landscape reserves an observation viewport: game canvas occupies 42.68% at800 and34.09% at667. The tower is unobscured but smaller. Human evaluation must judge minimum acceptable tower size.",
